WEBVTT

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:08.700
Zé takes care of our people.

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:13.700
Zé knows what the people need.

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:15.700
I'm with you, my senator.

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:18.700
I want schools.

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:21.700
I want Zé Reinaldo,

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:26.700
Zé Reinaldo for senator.

00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:28.000
I'm with Zé Reinaldo.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Zé Reinaldo. Senator.
